第三方素材致谢 / Third-party assets

本项目使用的角色立绘与音效来自 MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget
（`For–WinDesktop` 分支），该仓库以 MIT License 发布。
本仓库仅将其宿主环境（DSH 桌面挂件）替换为 WorkBuddy，未改动原始美术资源。
原始作品版权归原作者所有。

Character sprites and sound effects bundled in `assets/` come from
MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget (branch `For–WinDesktop`),
which is released under the MIT License. This project only re-hosts them
on top of WorkBuddy; the original artwork remains the property of its author.
